ign-system.test.ts.\n[2026-03-05T04:41:09.606Z] Jacob Chapel:\n[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: Review issues: required web-ui test command fails (missing npm test script) and kspec validate reports spec-specific status mismatch warning for @ui-design-system.\n[2026-03-05T04:55:43.148Z] @claude:\nFix cycle 1: Addressed both review findings. (1) Added 'test' script to packages/web-ui/package.json that delegates to root vitest for web-ui-design-system.test.ts — 'cd packages/web-ui && npm test' now passes all 18 tests. (2) Fixed spec status mismatch by resetting @ui-design-system implementation to not_started, and restored 19 unrelated specs that were incorrectly cascaded to not_started by the item set command.\n[2026-03-05T05:01:45.150Z] Jacob Chapel:\nReview findings: MUST-FIX - kspec validate reports a warning for this spec: UI Design System status mismatch (spec implementation='in_progress' but expected 'not_started' based on task progress). Required test sequence passed: root npm test (176 files, 3703 tests) and packages/web-ui npm test (18 tests). AC annotations for @ui-design-system ac-1..ac-4 are present in tests/web-ui-design-system.test.ts; no inherited trait ACs for this spec.\n[2026-03-05T05:01:48.158Z] Jacob Chapel:\n```\n"}}]}}
