plementation='in_progress' but expected 'not_started' based on task progress). Required test sequence passed: root npm test (176 files, 3703 tests) and packages/web-ui npm test (18 tests). AC annotations for @ui-design-system ac-1..ac-4 are present in tests/web-ui-design-system.test.ts; no inherited trait ACs for this spec.\n[2026-03-05T05:01:48.158Z] Jacob Chapel:\n[FIX_CYCLE: 2] Review findings: Review issues: MUST-FIX spec-specific kspec validate warning remains for @ui-design-system (status mismatch: implementation in_progress vs expected not_started).\n```"}}]}}
