.kspec/sessions/01KJY3FGB4W881DYXQ42PQHA59/events.jsonl:37:{"ts":1772684311759,"seq":36,"type":"session.update","session_id":"01KJY3FGB4W881DYXQ42PQHA59","data":{"_meta":{"claudeCode":{"toolResponse":{"stdout":"ULID:     01KJXSVF2YKCXMJGC55G1CPBV2\nTitle:    UI/UX Revamp\nStatus:   active\nSlugs:    plan-ui-ux-revamp\nCreated:  2026-03-05T01:30:02.718Z (2 hours ago)\n\nDerived Work:\n  Specs: @ui-design-system, @ui-app-shell, @ui-task-board, @ui-session-stream, @ui-agent-dispatch, @ui-session-history, @ui-inbox-enhanced, @ui-plans-view, @ui-validation-view, @ui-dashboard-overview\n  Tasks: @implement-ui-design-system, @implement-app-shell-and-navigation, @implement-task-board-kanban, @implement-session-stream-view, @implement-agent-and-dispatch-view, @implement-session-history, @implement-enhanced-inbox-view, @implement-plans-view, @implement-validation-and-alignment-view, @implement-dashboard-overview\n\n─── Content ───\n# UI/UX Revamp\n\n## Specs\n\n```yaml\n- title: \"UI Design System\"\n  slug: ui-design-system\n  type: feature\n  parent: \"@web-ui\"\n  description: |\n    Port imgen's design token architecture into kspec's Tailwind-based web UI.\n    Map oklch color tokens, spacing, radii, z-index, typography, and animation\n    keyframes as Tailwind theme extensions. Establish consistent visual language\n    across all views.\n  acceptance_criteria:\n    - id: ac-1\n      given: |\n        The web UI app.css file\n      when: |\n        imgen token-contract.css values are mapped as Tailwind @theme inline extensions\n      then: |\n        All 16 color tokens, 4 radii, 7 spacing, 7 z-index, and 3 font families\n        are available as Tailwind utility classes (e.g. bg-design-surface, border-design-border)\n    - id: ac-2\n      given: |\n        A component using design tokens\n      when: |\n        The dark theme tokens are applied\n      then: |\n        oklch colors render correctly and status colors (pending=amber, in_progress=orange,\n        pending_review=blue, needs_work=yellow, completed=emerald, blocked=red, cancelled=gray)\n        are visually distinct\n    - id: ac-3\n      given: |\n        A view with loading states\n      when: |\n        Content is loading\n      then: |\n        Shimmer animation plays on skeleton elements, gated behind prefers-reduced-motion\n    - id: ac-4\n      given: |\n        An active agent task card\n      when: |\n        The agent is working\n      then: |\n        Breathing/pulse animation plays on the card border, gated behind prefers-reduced-motion\n\n- title: \"App Shell and Navigation\"\n  slug: ui-app-shell\n  type: feature\n  parent: \"@web-ui\"\n  description: |\n    Restructure the web UI layout with collapsible sidebar navigation, header bar\n    with command palette and connection status, and grouped navigation sections.\n    Preserve existing functionality during migration.\n  acceptance_criteria:\n    - id: ac-1\n      given: |\n        The web UI loaded in daemon mode\n      when: |\n        The app shell renders\n      then: |\n        A collapsible sidebar shows grouped navigation: Work (Dashboard, Tasks, Agents, Sessions),\n        Specs (Specs, Plans, Validate), Capture (Inbox, Observations, Triage),\n        Config (Workflows, Settings)\n    - id: ac-2\n      given: |\n        Sidebar navigation items\n      when: |\n        Items have actionable counts (inbox items, unresolved observations, pending review tasks)\n      then: |\n        Badge counts display next to the relevant nav items\n    - id: ac-3\n      given: |\n        The /items route\n      when: |\n        A user navigates to /items\n      then: |\n        They are redirected to /specs preserving any query parameters\n    - id: ac-4\n      given: |\n        The Observations nav item\n      when: |\n        There are zero unresolved observations\n      then: |\n        The nav item is still visible (not hidden)\n\n- title: \"Task Board (Kanban)\"\n  slug: ui-task-board","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"toolName":"Bash"}},"toolCallId":"toolu_014q6H8WZaokRfjNoD59v1Gf","sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update"}}
.kspec/sessions/01KJY3FGB4W881DYXQ42PQHA59/events.jsonl:38:{"ts":1772684311760,"seq":37,"type":"session.update","session_id":"01KJY3FGB4W881DYXQ42PQHA59","data":{"_meta":{"claudeCode":{"toolName":"Bash"}},"toolCallId":"toolu_014q6H8WZaokRfjNoD59v1Gf","sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","status":"completed","rawOutput":"ULID:     01KJXSVF2YKCXMJGC55G1CPBV2\nTitle:    UI/UX Revamp\nStatus:   active\nSlugs:    plan-ui-ux-revamp\nCreated:  2026-03-05T01:30:02.718Z (2 hours ago)\n\nDerived Work:\n  Specs: @ui-design-system, @ui-app-shell, @ui-task-board, @ui-session-stream, @ui-agent-dispatch, @ui-session-history, @ui-inbox-enhanced, @ui-plans-view, @ui-validation-view, @ui-dashboard-overview\n  Tasks: @implement-ui-design-system, @implement-app-shell-and-navigation, @implement-task-board-kanban, @implement-session-stream-view, @implement-agent-and-dispatch-view, @implement-session-history, @implement-enhanced-inbox-view, @implement-plans-view, @implement-validation-and-alignment-view, @implement-dashboard-overview\n\n─── Content ───\n# UI/UX Revamp\n\n## Specs\n\n```yaml\n- title: \"UI Design System\"\n  slug: ui-design-system\n  type: feature\n  parent: \"@web-ui\"\n  description: |\n    Port imgen's design token architecture into kspec's Tailwind-based web UI.\n    Map oklch color tokens, spacing, radii, z-index, typography, and animation\n    keyframes as Tailwind theme extensions. Establish consistent visual language\n    across all views.\n  acceptance_criteria:\n    - id: ac-1\n      given: |\n        The web UI app.css file\n      when: |\n        imgen token-contract.css values are mapped as Tailwind @theme inline extensions\n      then: |\n        All 16 color tokens, 4 radii, 7 spacing, 7 z-index, and 3 font families\n        are available as Tailwind utility classes (e.g. bg-design-surface, border-design-border)\n    - id: ac-2\n      given: |\n        A component using design tokens\n      when: |\n        The dark theme tokens are applied\n      then: |\n        oklch colors render correctly and status colors (pending=amber, in_progress=orange,\n        pending_review=blue, needs_work=yellow, completed=emerald, blocked=red, cancelled=gray)\n        are visually distinct\n    - id: ac-3\n      given: |\n        A view with loading states\n      when: |\n        Content is loading\n      then: |\n        Shimmer animation plays on skeleton elements, gated behind prefers-reduced-motion\n    - id: ac-4\n      given: |\n        An active agent task card\n      when: |\n        The agent is working\n      then: |\n        Breathing/pulse animation plays on the card border, gated behind prefers-reduced-motion\n\n- title: \"App Shell and Navigation\"\n  slug: ui-app-shell\n  type: feature\n  parent: \"@web-ui\"\n  description: |\n    Restructure the web UI layout with collapsible sidebar navigation, header bar\n    with command palette and connection status, and grouped navigation sections.\n    Preserve existing functionality during migration.\n  acceptance_criteria:\n    - id: ac-1\n      given: |\n        The web UI loaded in daemon mode\n      when: |\n        The app shell renders\n      then: |\n        A collapsible sidebar shows grouped navigation: Work (Dashboard, Tasks, Agents, Sessions),\n        Specs (Specs, Plans, Validate), Capture (Inbox, Observations, Triage),\n        Config (Workflows, Settings)\n    - id: ac-2\n      given: |\n        Sidebar navigation items\n      when: |\n        Items have actionable counts (inbox items, unresolved observations, pending review tasks)\n      then: |\n        Badge counts display next to the relevant nav items\n    - id: ac-3\n      given: |\n        The /items route\n      when: |\n        A user navigates to /items\n      then: |\n        They are redirected to /specs preserving any query parameters\n    - id: ac-4\n      given: |\n        The Observations nav item\n      when: |\n        There are zero unresolved observations\n      then: |\n        The nav item is still visible (not hidden)\n\n- title: \"Task Board (Kanban)\"\n  slug: ui-task-board","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"```console\nULID:     01KJXSVF2YKCXMJGC55G1CPBV2\nTitle:    UI/UX Revamp\nStatus:   active\nSlugs:    plan-ui-ux-revamp\nCreated:  2026-03-05T01:30:02.718Z (2 hours ago)\n\nDerived Work:\n  Specs: @ui-design-system, @ui-app-shell, @ui-task-board, @ui-session-stream, @ui-agent-dispatch, @ui-session-history, @ui-inbox-enhanced, @ui-plans-view, @ui-validation-view, @ui-dashboard-overview\n  Tasks: @implement-ui-design-system, @implement-app-shell-and-navigation, @implement-task-board-kanban, @implement-session-stream-view, @implement-agent-and-dispatch-view, @implement-session-history, @implement-enhanced-inbox-view, @implement-plans-view, @implement-validation-and-alignment-view, @implement-dashboard-overview\n\n─── Content ───\n# UI/UX Revamp\n\n## Specs\n\n```yaml\n- title: \"UI Design System\"\n  slug: ui-design-system\n  type: feature\n  parent: \"@web-ui\"\n  description: |\n    Port imgen's design token architecture into kspec's Tailwind-based web UI.\n    Map oklch color tokens, spacing, radii, z-index, typography, and animation\n    keyframes as Tailwind theme extensions. Establish consistent visual language\n    across all views.\n  acceptance_criteria:\n    - id: ac-1\n      given: |\n        The web UI app.css file\n      when: |\n        imgen token-contract.css values are mapped as Tailwind @theme inline extensions\n      then: |\n        All 16 color tokens, 4 radii, 7 spacing, 7 z-index, and 3 font families\n        are available as Tailwind utility classes (e.g. bg-design-surface, border-design-border)\n    - id: ac-2\n      given: |\n        A component using design tokens\n      when: |\n        The dark theme tokens are applied\n      then: |\n        oklch colors render correctly and status colors (pending=amber, in_progress=orange,\n        pending_review=blue, needs_work=yellow, completed=emerald, blocked=red, cancelled=gray)\n        are visually distinct\n    - id: ac-3\n      given: |\n        A view with loading states\n      when: |\n        Content is loading\n      then: |\n        Shimmer animation plays on skeleton elements, gated behind prefers-reduced-motion\n    - id: ac-4\n      given: |\n        An active agent task card\n      when: |\n        The agent is working\n      then: |\n        Breathing/pulse animation plays on the card border, gated behind prefers-reduced-motion\n\n- title: \"App Shell and Navigation\"\n  slug: ui-app-shell\n  type: feature\n  parent: \"@web-ui\"\n  description: |\n    Restructure the web UI layout with collapsible sidebar navigation, header bar\n    with command palette and connection status, and grouped navigation sections.\n    Preserve existing functionality during migration.\n  acceptance_criteria:\n    - id: ac-1\n      given: |\n        The web UI loaded in daemon mode\n      when: |\n        The app shell renders\n      then: |\n        A collapsible sidebar shows grouped navigation: Work (Dashboard, Tasks, Agents, Sessions),\n        Specs (Specs, Plans, Validate), Capture (Inbox, Observations, Triage),\n        Config (Workflows, Settings)\n    - id: ac-2\n      given: |\n        Sidebar navigation items\n      when: |\n        Items have actionable counts (inbox items, unresolved observations, pending review tasks)\n      then: |\n        Badge counts display next to the relevant nav items\n    - id: ac-3\n      given: |\n        The /items route\n      when: |\n        A user navigates to /items\n      then: |\n        They are redirected to /specs preserving any query parameters\n    - id: ac-4\n      given: |\n        The Observations nav item\n      when: |\n        There are zero unresolved observations\n      then: |\n        The nav item is still visible (not hidden)\n\n- title: \"Task Board (Kanban)\"\n  slug: ui-task-board\n```"}}]}}
